#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:5 9aa78553388f4a688b90270de8fd0e9f
msgid "Guided mode"
msgstr "Guided 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:7 cad6452bc1c4415eb12182f00fde6200
msgid ""
"Guided mode is designed to allow ground stations or :ref:`companion "
"computers <common-companion-computers>` to control the vehicle."
msgstr "Guided 模式旨在允许地面站或 :ref:`伴随计算机 <common-companion-computers>` 控制车辆。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:10 211edc34211a4f1f86cd085c17e176de
msgid "Sending Commands from the Ground Station"
msgstr "从地面站发送命令"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:12 5bca009a8d9d4f02bed6e1fc1592ee56
msgid ""
"Most ground stations support commanding the vehicle to drive to a "
"location specified by clicking on the map.  If using the Mission Planner:"
msgstr "大多数地面站支持通过点击地图上的位置来命令车辆驶向该位置。如果使用 Mission Planner："

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:14 0b3e0a44e2f24e8eba427f51a235dcf9
msgid ""
"connect to the vehicle with a :ref:`telemetry radio <common-telemetry-"
"landingpage>`"
msgstr "通过 :ref:`数传无线电 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 连接到车辆"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:15 5bdeceebe7ad40eda94ae3c00ab76405
msgid ""
"from the Flight Data screen, right-mouse-button click on the map and "
"select \"Fly To Here\"."
msgstr "在飞行数据界面，右键点击地图并选择「Fly To Here」。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:16 5d0f51a3b1f44ae793f2102531a14181
msgid ""
"the vehicle will switch to Guided mode and attempted to drive to the "
"location specified."
msgstr "车辆将切换到 Guided 模式并尝试驶向指定位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:17 c3d185c4d53646b3b010acf75f5e5acb
msgid ""
"once at the destination it will hold position if a surface vehicle, or "
"loiter/circle around the destination if it is a boat."
msgstr "到达目的地后，若为地面车辆则保持位置，若为船则在目的地周围 Loiter/绕圈。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:22 f51d572155de414e9c52009900b9fe42
msgid ""
"The ground station will normally set the vehicle to Guided mode before "
"the target destination is sent meaning it is not necessary to set up "
"Guided mode on the :ref:`transmitter mode switch <common-rc-transmitter-"
"flight-mode-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"地面站通常会在发送目标位置之前将车辆设置为 Guided 模式，这意味着无需在 :ref:`发射器模式开关 <common-rc-"
"transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>` 上设置 Guided 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:25 fbf2e41f566640239afdd0717dd7a59a
msgid "Speed"
msgstr "速度"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:27 eebaeb40f69f430ba94fb80fcf6c5267
msgid ""
"While the vehicle is travelling, the user can increase the vehicle's "
"speed by raising the transmitter's throttle stick to between 75% and "
"100%.  At 75% the vehicle will remain at it's configured speed (i.e. "
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` or :ref:`CRUISE <CRUISE_SPEED>` if "
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` is zero, versions of Rover after 3.5.1 use "
"only :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>`), this linearly increases to the "
"vehicle's maximum speed as the pilot's throttle stick reaches 100%."
msgstr ""
"在车辆行进过程中，用户可以将遥控器的油门杆提高到 75% 到 100% 之间来增加车辆速度。在 75% 时车辆将保持其配置速度（即 "
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>`，或当 :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` 为零时使用 "
":ref:`CRUISE <CRUISE_SPEED>`，Rover 3.5.1 之后的版本仅使用 :ref:`WP_SPEED "
"<WP_SPEED>`），随着飞手油门杆达到 100%，速度线性增加到车辆最大速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:30 5826e9751351400ea483f96e6edcbd62
msgid "Other controls"
msgstr "其他控制"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:32 7411d525f0764eacb9e49281131c8e00
msgid ""
"These additional MAVLink messages are supported in Guided mode.  These "
"are listed mostly for developers of ground stations or :ref:`companion "
"computers <common-companion-computers>` applications:"
msgstr ""
"Guided 模式支持这些额外的 MAVLink 消息。这些主要列举供地面站或 :ref:`伴随计算机 <common-companion-"
"computers>` 应用程序开发者参考："

